## Docs

The documentation site lives in `docs/`, is configured by `zensical.toml` and
is built with [Zensical](https://zensical.org/):

```bash
uv run --only-group docs zensical serve
```
{%- if docs_hosting == 'github-pages' %}

The site is built and deployed to GitHub Pages by
`.github/workflows/deploy.yml`. You have to tell GitHub to deploy the site with
GitHub Actions: Settings → Pages → Build and deployment → Source → GitHub
Actions
{%- elif docs_hosting == 'gitlab-pages' %}

The site is built and deployed to GitLab Pages by `.gitlab-ci.yml`.
{%- endif %}
{%- endif %}
